    "summary": "The user asks for advice on whether to double the dose of iron supplements for their 14-year-old daughter to treat anemia more quickly. The assistant initially gives contradictory and nonsensical advice (saying she shouldn't take them at all while simultaneously saying she should take two pills), but eventually corrects itself to advise following the bottle's instructions and warns that a suggested high dose (650mg) would be lethal.",
